[2.07, "o", "openapi-mocker dev serving the built-in Petstore on http://localhost:8080\r\n  health: http://localhost:8080/healthz\r\n  management API: http://localhost:8080/__mocker/api/projects/default/...\r\n  GET     /pets\r\n  POST    /pets\r\n  DELETE  /pets/{petId}\r\n  GET     /pets/{petId}\r\n  PUT     /pets/{petId}\r\n  stateful: POST, PUT, PATCH and DELETE change what later GETs return\r\n\r\nTry it:  curl http://localhost:8080/pets\r\nPress Ctrl+C to stop.\r\n"]
